# Note: app-icon.svg (vector master) and app-icon.png (1024 raster) are the
# committed icon sources. ImageMagick cannot rasterize the SVG's gradients —
# re-render it with a WebKit renderer (e.g. macOS `qlmanage -t -s 1024`) to
# refresh app-icon.png, then `npm run tauri icon src-tauri/app-icon.png`.
# The macOS icons/icon.icns is additionally rounded + inset (Apple grid).
